NAME
       du - estimate file space usage

SYNOPSIS
       du [OPTION]... [FILE]...

DESCRIPTION
       Summarize disk usage of each FILE, recursively for directories. Sizes
       are in kilobytes unless -h or -b is given.

OPTIONS
       -a
           write counts for all files, not just directories

       -s
           display only a total for each argument

       -h
           print sizes in human readable format

       -b
           apparent size in bytes

       -c
           produce a grand total

       -d N, --max-depth=N
           print totals only for directories N or fewer levels deep

EXAMPLES
       du -sh /usr
       du -h -d 1 /

SEE ALSO
       df(1), ls(1)
